    alt="✨"
    title="sparkles"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/2728.svg"> &#191;Profec&#237;a o memoria? <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
